Third-party data bundled with this software
================================================================================

MITRE ATT&CK®
-------------
inspecthor/data/attack_enterprise.json is a slimmed-down derivative of the MITRE
ATT&CK Enterprise matrix (version 19.1), built from the STIX 2.1 dataset published
at https://github.com/mitre-attack/attack-stix-data. Technique identifiers, names,
tactics, platforms, descriptions and detection notes are reproduced from that
dataset; the file is reduced to those fields so the tool can resolve technique
names offline.

