================================================================================
Detection rules
================================================================================

The YARA rules in inspecthor/data/yara/ and the Sigma rules in
inspecthor/data/sigma/ were written for this project and are covered by the
project's MIT license. They are a deliberately small starter set, not a detection
suite; point the tool at a real ruleset for coverage.

